{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 582304, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 116296, "uid": 107851, "type": 4, "title": "23-2-02抽卡建议", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1675244065, "updated_at": 1675245133, "updated_uid": 107851, "comment_at": 1675296604, "last_at": 1675909067, "comment_count": 9, "status": 1, "summary": "👇本期对策保底池天子必抽，请注意蓝色Pass为保底任务30发不中可通过Pass任务获取一个RB宝石，集中加速技能攻击力技能非常强力，卡面也非常香，新手必抽👇本期对策宇宙池，会歪且上不封顶，手痒可以", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 6, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 17128, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "广西", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 582304, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">👇本期对策保底池</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">天子必抽，请注意蓝色Pass为保底任务</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">30发不中可通过Pass任务获取一个</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">RB宝石，集中加速技能攻击力技能非常强力，卡面也非常香，新手必抽</span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/723107.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/723107.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">👇本期对策宇宙池，会歪且上不封顶，手痒可以抽</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/910362.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/910362.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">👇皮肤骗氪池，罗刹已退出RB舞台（吃史依旧强力一刀一个），</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">没必要抽</span><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/86023.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/86023.png\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/815040.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/815040.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">👇2个RB宝石<span style=\"\">池，只出列表的的，上不封顶</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">有用和无用55开，有奥拉夫的池子可以碰碰运气，如果宝石3缺1也有可能抽到破产都不出，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">不建议硬抽</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/290529.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/290529.png\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/265359.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/265359.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">👇光属性血石宇宙池，</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">不要不要不要抽</span><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/955355.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/955355.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">👇9号出现的活动中期发带池，上不封顶</span><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">发带池容易抽退坑，这期质量一般并不推荐去抽</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">根据个人钻石数量来算8W抽不满4只就及时退出止损，3缺1抽到破产比比皆是</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">由上至下，由左到右：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\">红莲</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">：恶心人的红莲，没奶很难活，乱斗有发挥空间，5人PVP基本看不到</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">天鹅</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">：PvP偶像队之一，前期上分比较好用，现在异常队被克制的比较厉害</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">老板娘</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">：遇事不决老板娘，地狱星云有发挥空间，乱斗出场率极高</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\">老八</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">：YYDS，卡面，强度在线，PVP火队主力</span></div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/840272.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/840272.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">👇光属性宇宙池，上不封顶，</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">别抽</span><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/512585.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/512585.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">👇</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">暗属性魂卡，宝石池，</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">魂卡卷开不出就抽吧，单张一个宝石，还是划算的</span><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/699231.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/699231.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">👇</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">光属性魂卡，宝石池2，可遇不可求，3张卡0凑3有难度，只抽上一池就差不多了，</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">碰碰运气抽个巨攻也可以</span><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/100833.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2023/1/1/100833.png\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 107851, "username": "xyzpace", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/18.png", "description": "萌新之友，已重开，真萌新", "follow_num": 1413, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "夏日蓝调", "tag_color": "#00B0F0"}, "role_id": 1, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 3, "content_at": 65872669, "content_num": 239, "read_num": 5044844, "like_num": 3644}, "update_user": {"uid": 107851, "username": "xyzpace", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/18.png", "description": "萌新之友，已重开，真萌新", "follow_num": 1413, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 3, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 107851, "username": "xyzpace", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/18.png", "last_ip_are